Files under languages/ come from Helix (https://github.com/helix-editor/helix)
as packaged by nixpkgs:

- languages/*/*.scm are Helix's queries, copied unmodified from its
  runtime/queries, under the Mozilla Public License 2.0:
  https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/
- languages/languages.json is derived from Helix's languages.toml (MPL-2.0).
- overrides/*/*.scm adapt patterns from Helix's queries, also MPL-2.0.
- languages/*/grammar.wasm are built from the tree-sitter grammars Helix pins
  for Nix, bash, Python, JSON, TOML, regex and markdown, all MIT licensed.

SOURCES records the Helix version and each grammar's revision.
